<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CENBANK 2-WEEK REPO AVG YIELD 14.49 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>CZECH CENBANK 2-WEEK REPO AVG YIELD 14.49 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield in a Czech National Bank two-week repo tender on Tuesday was the maximum 14.49 percent, down slightly from 14.5 percent on Monday, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>All bids at the maximum were accepted.</p>
<p>The central bank does not disclose the volume on offer or completed transactions.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom +420-2-2423-0003</p>
